  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The video player allowlist needs an overhaul. Currently, it's either allow the entire Internet through, or just allow what VRChat has deemed \"trusted\", which many people don't even agree with. I for example, don't trust many of these platforms VRChat allows through by default, many of them have porn, gore and other inappropriate content that you will be forced to see without blackholing these services outside of VRChat.\n\nI think VRChat should implement a system that allows for more granular control. Still have the default list of \"trusted\" URLs, but allow for those to be removed individually, and allow people to add their own if they choose to. The \"Allow Untrusted URLs\" could be kept too, for those who don't care at all.\n\nThis would make for a safer experience for those who don't want to see videos at all and for those who do.",
